-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
AltimateAI/data-engineering-skills
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Upstream:  https://github.com/AltimateAI/data-engineering-skills
Licence:   MIT
Copyright: Copyright (c) 2026 AltimateAI

Ten skills were adapted into artifacts in this catalog. The upstream repository
also contains an eleventh skill, `altimate-code`, which delegates to the
upstream author's own tooling; it was deliberately not taken.

Adaptation was not a verbatim copy. Upstream ships Claude Code skills whose
frontmatter carries trigger conditions inside a multi-line `description`. This
catalog selects artifacts through `applies_to`, `strength`, and `topics` in
`index.json` and `metadata.json`, so those triggers were re-expressed as catalog
metadata. Prose was edited for house style and to remove upstream-specific
assumptions. The substance of each workflow — its steps, its verification gates,
and its stated rules — is upstream's.

Artifacts derived from this source:

  DBT-MODEL-CREATION          <- skills/dbt/creating-dbt-models
  DBT-ERROR-DEBUGGING         <- skills/dbt/debugging-dbt-errors
  DBT-INCREMENTAL-MODELS      <- skills/dbt/developing-incremental-models
  DBT-MODEL-TESTING           <- skills/dbt/testing-dbt-models
  DBT-MODEL-REFACTORING       <- skills/dbt/refactoring-dbt-models
  DBT-SQL-MIGRATION           <- skills/dbt/migrating-sql-to-dbt
  DBT-MODEL-DOCUMENTATION     <- skills/dbt/documenting-dbt-models
  SNOWFLAKE-EXPENSIVE-QUERIES <- skills/snowflake/finding-expensive-queries
  SNOWFLAKE-QUERY-BY-ID       <- skills/snowflake/optimizing-query-by-id
  SNOWFLAKE-QUERY-TEXT        <- skills/snowflake/optimizing-query-text

